# Visual baselines (.fuutu/visual-baselines/) are committed — Linux only.
# Local dev on macOS/Windows generates platform-suffixed files that must
# never land in the repo; CI regenerates + commits -linux variants on merge.
.fuutu/visual-baselines/**/*-darwin.png
.fuutu/visual-baselines/**/*-win32.png

